{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "list_item", "parent_tag": "0038", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$M : \\mathcal{I} \\to \\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\lim_\\mathcal{I} M$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{D}$", "MATH_0004": "$v(\\lim_\\mathcal{I} M) =\n\\lim_\\mathcal{I} v \\circ M$", "MATH_0005": "$v$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\item ", "suffix": "\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{lemma}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8d6201f7d176e402ec435f25d952faba45baeb0f03c1ccbeba99366e7a1b2f66", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:86aca84328500c971d3ebe107e7bb0bbbe9f4f6038426cada6a7a88bb385be97", "source_text": "Suppose that <MATH_0001> is a diagram, and suppose that <MATH_0002> exists in <MATH_0003>. Then <MATH_0004>. In other words <MATH_0005> commutes with representable limits.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ffb6c23fb8221e1fcf03b0aabb097feed3bdcfd3349e24a5d9adfca0625dc8ad", "unit_id": "tag:0038:item002"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0038", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{categories-remark-limit-colim}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:56abc9800509df862349ba7648bbc03565160c641b1fdc3d0f828b4563f7fd60", "source_text": "A morphism from a colimit into an object is the same as a compatible system of morphisms from the constituents of the limit into the object, see Remark <REF_0001>. So", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9cf7b0be7c91aed1152bccfeb71089d6bcef52bc5fa59c97ce0b95bf0c1e26af", "unit_id": "tag:0038:proof-p001"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "display_math", "parent_tag": "0038", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\n\\begin{matrix}\n\\Mor_\\mathcal{D}(u(\\colim_{i \\in \\mathcal{I}} M_i), Y) &\n= & \\Mor_\\mathcal{C}(\\colim_{i \\in \\mathcal{I}} M_i, v(Y)) \\\\\n& = &\n\\lim_{i \\in \\mathcal{I}^{opp}}\n\\Mor_\\mathcal{C}(M_i, v(Y)) \\\\\n& = &\n\\lim_{i \\in \\mathcal{I}^{opp}}\n\\Mor_\\mathcal{D}(u(M_i), Y)\n\\end{matrix}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d440993b200a046d5c764c7fe4b4caf338cdf0211f074efbe868f70ce94d5c6e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5ede6a36f5722a4aa9f45a6c89e302babd600f8d73f0e7ce76ebbe31722a778a", "source_text": "<MATH_0001>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f624e62d0a08cb4d4f7609fd8d992c88c0c527d3d910b8338b5f898e6261de67", "unit_id": "tag:0038:proof-display001"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof_paragraph", "parent_tag": "0038", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$u(\\colim_{i \\in \\mathcal{I}} M_i)$"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": "\n\\end{proof}\n\n"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:61a24fd798ccca7e99a782ed3a88de5f195ee62407d0b038bc8a91e943605918", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:d2fafa85a26eae0b3ebc7b54ed00d4631d277f3f0fc3661c50417f602747fcb0", "source_text": "proves that <MATH_0001> is the colimit we are looking for. A similar argument works for the other statement.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c8400c3de927d0e8c4dda66b56bd3091c727313282a89e7ad06685a53869714b", "unit_id": "tag:0038:proof-p002"}
